    "chunk_text": "\u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to manianne \u00f0a unge\u00f0yldegan, & on o\u00f0re \u00f0a ge\u00f0yldegan. On o\u00f0re wisan sint to manianne \u00fea unge\u00f0yldegan, on o\u00f0re \u00f0a ge\u00f0yldegan. \u00d0\u00e6m unge\u00f0yldegum is to s\u00e6cganne \u00f0\u00e6tte hie ne agimeleasien \u00f0\u00e6t hie hiera mod gebridligen, Sw\u00e6 hit oft gebyre\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t sio hatheortnes & seo hr\u00e6dwilnes \u00f0\u00e6t mod gebreng\u00f0 on \u00f0\u00e6m weorce \u00fee For\u00f0\u00e6m him is to s\u00e6cgeanne \u00f0\u00e6t hie weor\u00f0a\u00f0 oft ascrencte on \u00f0\u00e6m scyfe \u00f0\u00e6re styringe hiera Ac gif he \u00f0onne \u00f0\u00e6re styringe ne wi\u00f0stent, \u00f0onne gescent he \u00f0a godan weorc \u00fee he oft \u00e6r on And sw\u00e6 ungleawlice for \u00f0\u00e6m scyfe \u00f0\u00e6re styringe swi\u00f0e hr\u00e6dlice towyrp\u00f0 \u00fea godan weorc \u00fee And \u00f0a ge\u00f0ylde \u00fee is modur & hierde ealra m\u00e6gena for \u00f0\u00e6m unwrence \u00f0\u00e6re unge\u00f0ylde forlett, Hit is awriten on Paules bocum \u00f0\u00e6t sio Godes lufu sie ge\u00f0yld, & se \u00fee ge\u00f0yldig ne sie, \u00f0\u00e6t he For \u00f0\u00e6m un\u00f0eawe \u00f0\u00e6re unge\u00f0ylde wier\u00f0 utadrifen sio fostermodur \u00e6lcre leornunga & \u00e6lces Ne m\u00e6g he no ryhtlice ge\u00f0yld l\u00e6ran, buton he self ge\u00f0yldelice o\u00f0erra monna teonan ge\u00f0olige. Hwilum eac gebyre\u00f0 for \u00f0\u00e6m un\u00f0eawe \u00f0\u00e6re unge\u00f0ylde \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6t mod wier\u00f0 gesticced",
